Third-party notice

dsh-context-diet is a DeepSeek Harness (DSH) port of the design, selection
policy and stub format of pi-context-diet, a pi extension by sorinirimies
(https://github.com/sorinirimies/pi-context-diet, MIT). The upstream copyright
notice above is retained because this port derives its policy and substantial
portions of its implementation intent from that project. The two runtimes do
not share semantics: upstream rewrites one request's messages only, while this
port appends durable DSH session surface replacements.
